{% block introduction %}
<p>
	The TTPA Application Profile provides a minimal set of classes.
  These are intended to support <a href="https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/HTML/?uri=OJ:L_202400900#cpt_II">Chapter II to the Regulation (EU) 2024/900 of the European Parliament and of the Council and </a> <a href="https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/HTML/?uri=OJ:L_202501410#anx_I">annex to the Regulation (EU) 2025/1410 of the European Parliament and of the Council</a>. 
</p>
{% endblock %}


{% block summary %}
<section id="abstract">
    <h2>Abstract</h2>
The TTPA Application Profile is
a data model that provides a minimum set of classes and properties for the European repository for online political advertisements.
</section>
{% endblock %}

